+From: Emre Yavuzalp <emreyavuzalp@gmail.com>
+Subject: econet-eth: add the PPE/FOE hardware-offload driver files (stage 1)
+
+Recovered from the en7528 development build. These are the standalone PPE
+(Packet Processing Engine) / FOE (Flow Offload Engine) sources for the
+EN751221-class MTK PPE "V1": engine bring-up, FOE table tuple builders and
+the nf_flowtable offload glue. They are not yet wired into Kbuild or the
+RX/probe paths (stage 2) and econet_foe.c still needs the big-endian tuple
+byte-swap for the EN751221 (stage 3). Kept in disabled/ until integrated.
