+    "bind hit" code appearing means binding works and the issue is egress.
+
+ 2. On the first commits, log our own en75_foe_entry_hash() next to the
+    hardware-reported hw_slot. HASH-DIFF means the two disagree, i.e. the
+    descriptor field is not the FOE index and we should write at the SW hash.
+
+Pure diagnostics; no behaviour change. Remove once the cause is known.
