+From: Emre Yavuzalp <emreyavuzalp@gmail.com>
+Subject: econet-eth: restore RX tuple parser length checks
+
+The stale offload diagnostics patch carried useful skb bounds checks in the RX
+tuple parser. Once that patch is removed from the stack, keep those checks in a
+small standalone patch so malformed or short VLAN/IP/IPv6 frames cannot drive
+out-of-bounds tuple reads while the PPE bind path is being debugged.
