+The current C5v PPE pipeline can hash, punt and bind flows, and L2 rewrite
+diagnostics show valid next-hop MACs, but bound flows still do not leave the
+CPU path. That points at the EN751221-specific FE/PSE/GDMA/CDMA forward path
+rather than at FOE tuple or L2 construction.
+
+Dump the relevant FE-side forwarding registers when PPE is enabled. This is a
